== the REFUSAL, executed rather than described ==
A narrative claiming a count its stdout does not print is refused, and
the refusal names the count. The pair is fabricated here so the
direction is proved on the RULE rather than on whatever this directory
happens to hold; the same two directions are asserted from the closing
test below, and the same refusal is driven against the real report by
the mutation control suites-report-carries-an-underived-number.

cwd       <repo>
command   python -c "import sys; sys.stdout.reconfigure(newline=chr(10)); import importlib.util as u; s=u.spec_from_file_location('a','backend/tests/evidence/assemble-evidence.py'); m=u.module_from_spec(s); s.loader.exec_module(m); print('derivable   ->', m.undrivable('the run hashed 9 paths', '9 paths'))"
derivable   -> []
clean rc=0

cwd       <repo>
command   python -c "import sys; sys.stdout.reconfigure(newline=chr(10)); import importlib.util as u; s=u.spec_from_file_location('a','backend/tests/evidence/assemble-evidence.py'); m=u.module_from_spec(s); s.loader.exec_module(m); print('undrivable  ->', m.undrivable('the run hashed 12 paths', '9 paths'))"
